{"quest_id": 8137, "name": "温泉を巡る争い", "description": "仙薬湯を探しつつ温泉で休憩する王子たち。\nすると何処からか現れた小人が、温泉の\nお湯を運ぼうと大猿と喧嘩を始めて……？\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "魔女と闘士と温泉郷", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920208, "map_no": 4829, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 50, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 3, "hp": 2800, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 196, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2149584, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 1, "master_id": 36986, "global_id": 10603, "to_global_id": 10604, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 2}]}}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 3, "hp": 2800, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2149520, "race_id": 14, "special_effect_id": 1610, "change_to": 2, "missile_id": 974, "missile": {"speed": 12.0}, "master_id": 36987, "global_id": 10604, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 10605}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 2, "form_count": 3, "hp": 2800, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1500, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 196, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2149584, "race_id": 14, "special_effect_id": 1613, "master_id": 36988, "global_id": 10605}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 3, "hp": 3500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 128, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2149616, "special_effect_id": 54, "change_to": 4, "master_id": 36989, "global_id": 10606, "to_global_id": 10607, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 2}]}}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 3, "hp": 3500, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 240, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 129, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2149632, "special_effect_id": 1616, "change_to": 5, "missile_id": 978, "missile": {"speed": 8.0}, "master_id": 36990, "global_id": 10607, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 10608}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 2, "form_count": 3, "hp": 3500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1800, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 128, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2149616, "special_effect_id": 1614, "master_id": 36991, "global_id": 10608}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 122, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2137056, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 34917, "global_id": 8534, "spawn_sec": 95}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2800, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 196, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104272, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 8, "master_id": 517, "global_id": 516, "to_global_id": 517, "spawn_sec": 101}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2800, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 105, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104320, "race_id": 14, "change_to": 7, "missile_id": 131, "missile": {"speed": 12.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 518, "global_id": 517, "ranged": true}], "popups": ["敵ユニットが\n温泉に入っている間、\nHPが徐々に回復します。\n\n温泉から上がった敵ユニットは\n防御力が上昇します。", "小人は一定確率で\n物理攻撃を回避します。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "モモ", "text": "──良いお湯だったー！", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "おや、お二人も休憩ですか？", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "そうなんよー。あ、聞いてよアカネさん。\nあっちの方に美肌効果のある温泉があってさー、\n少し休んだらもう一回入ろーって話してたの。", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "アカネさんも一緒にどう？", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "それは構いませんが……\n我々は仙薬湯を探していたのでは？", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "ああっ！？　忘れてたー！？", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "あはは、途中から完全に温泉旅行だったわー。", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "ああ、いえ、すみません。\n旅行気分でと言ったのは私でしたね、\n急かしたいわけではなかったのですが──", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "フィーヌ", "text": "──大変ですー！　こっちに来てくださーい！", "face": "u1415a1"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "どしたんフィーヌん、そんなに慌てちゃってー。", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "フィーヌ", "text": "あれ！　あれ見てください！", "face": "u1415a1"}, {"name": "小人A", "text": "お湯運ぶ！　収入得る！　お湯運ぶ！　収入得る！", "face": "l1fe681a94ab0"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "小人たちが温泉のお湯を運んでいる……？", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "小人B", "text": "敵倒す！　借金返す！　敵倒す！　お菓子買う！", "face": "l1fe681a94ab0"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "こっちはなにー！？", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "フィーヌ", "text": "お湯をどこかに運ぶ小人さんと、\nそれを止めようとしてるお猿さんで、\nさっきから大喧嘩しちゃってるんです！", "face": "u1415a1"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "ちょ、止めないとやばくない！？", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "温泉郷が滅茶苦茶だよー！？", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "（ここは近隣の住民すら知らぬ、\n隔絶の秘境のはず……なぜ小人が？）", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "いえ、まずは彼らの蛮行を阻止せねばですね。", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "フィーヌ", "text": "ちなみにここは守勢の湯だそうです！", "face": "u1415a1"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "なら防御力アップってことだね！\nよーし、気合入れて戦っちゃうよ！", "face": "u597"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "モモ", "text": "ていやーっ！", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "小人A", "text": "ぶべらっ！？", "face": "l1fe681a94ab0"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "サイズ感が一緒！", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "小人A", "text": "敗北！　貧乏！　借金地獄！", "face": "l1fe681a94ab0"}, {"name": "小人B", "text": "夜逃げ！　失踪！　新天地！", "face": "l1fe681a94ab0"}, {"name": "フィーヌ", "text": "な、なんだか罪悪感が……。", "face": "u1415a1"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "それにしても、どうして小人さんがここに？", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "小人たちを誘導した者がいるということでしょう。\nそこにいるのは分かっています……姿を現しなさい！", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "マズゥ", "text": "鋭いねぇ……腹立たしいほどに。", "face": "ld3205ffa4bb6"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "マズゥ！？", "face": "u597"}, {"name": "アカネ", "text": "最初から尾行されていたのでしょうね。\n目的はおそらく、モモさんの監視ですか。", "face": "u1678a1"}, {"name": "マズゥ", "text": "ご名答、投薬後の経過観察は重要だからね。\nそれがなんだい、あたしの術を解こうだって？", "face": "ld3205ffa4bb6"}, {"name": "マズゥ", "text": "そんなことはさせないよって、\nこっそり後をつけたら大当たりじゃないか。\n素敵な温泉郷だねぇ、あたしゃ知らなかったよ。", "face": "ld3205ffa4bb6"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "（あー、これ怒られるパターン？）", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "マズゥ", "text": "ここは研究材料の宝庫さ。\n仙薬湯はあたしがもらっとくよ、\nあんたらには一滴たりとも渡さないね。", "face": "ld3205ffa4bb6"}, {"name": "小人C", "text": "包囲殲滅！　包囲殲滅！", "face": "l1fe681a94ab0"}, {"name": "ミカ", "text": "囲まれてるぅ！　んー、やばない？", "face": "u2045a1"}, {"name": "モモ", "text": "どっ、どうしよー！？", "face": "u597"}]}], "active": true}